    answer: "The Board Seat is quarterly advisory to a family group's board or a founder's leadership team, held at governance level rather than operations. It runs to 8–10 groups at ₹25L to ₹55L a year: four board meetings attended in person, the annual coherence re-score, the constitution review, and availability to the chair.",
